# The fake board runs the firmware core, written for one core of a microcontroller, on host threads,
# and the tests read the board's state from theirs. Races there are the harness's, not the
# library's; a race with a frame in src/ is still reported.
race:tests/e2e/fake_board.c
race:tests/e2e/test_e2e.cpp
race:firmware/common/
